gis caésus sum,* semel lapi-dátus sum: ter naufrá¬</l><l xml:id="m-0de72c56-1a11-4f4b-b838-b5bbfb4732bf" facs="#m-2968efd4-9521-42c7-96e7-7ef5fbcbcac7" label="lyrics-like">pro Chrí-sti nómine. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-b82958e3-21a4-4b6a-9b98-e15e5a6c4fc5" facs="#m-5840c198-5031-43fe-89e9-15c83ab8008a" label="lyrics-like">gi-um pértu-li</l><l xml:id="m-aaec40c0-b47b-496a-b69d-c10dbf544862" facs="#m-a081e77e-f101-4f01-9b82-b81a4126201e" label="ambiguous">Act. 9.</l><l xml:id="m-2a098da7-bbb4-49e9-a54e-4eea433eac29" facs="#m-a4108fc6-39b5-4a1f-ad3a-24674000c017" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-300cc942-5d7d-45c5-87c4-397b660a0897" facs="#m-b2499bd0-955a-43e3-b518-42aff8919e11" label="lyrics-like">NAulus adhuc spirans minárum et scum ad synagógas: "* ut si quos</l><l xml:id="m-7eb2286f-29bd-4166-a719-9aab42ed4770" facs="#m-fabcb017-08f4-4f54-ad4a-dcd3cb3d0e01" label="ambiguous">invenisset hujus viae viros ac mulie¬</l><l xml:id="m-75abef90-0c19-47e2-90c5-b375b3180435" facs="#m-f2cc7fe4-ecda-4bde-91e6-e9817eb010b8" label="lyrics-like">O caedis in disclpulos Dómini. ac¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b5eea2e-842b-45ac-903b-bc77a1650348" facs="#m-a50cb425-55c1-44ae-b10f-6c97e85d61c4" label="lyrics-like">céssit ad principem sacerdótum, tl res, vinctos perdúceret in Jerúsalem.</l><l xml:id="m-b9859b4f-0005-44ee-80a7-e490b8bfee60" facs="#m-88024bd0-d8a3-4dd5-97f5-eaa21d8faaea" label="lyrics-like">et pétiit ab eo epistolas in Damá¬</l><l xml:id="m-8de20b1f-1159-49e5-871d-422bc71290ce" facs="#m-3852eb95-78f8-4d25-a6f1-3ef360365a95" label="ambiguous">Hymn.)</l><l xml:id="m-2b356018-db6c-4388-9dd7-fd9b8f9b311b" facs="#m-a72cd34d-1865-4add-8bad-fbded134f859" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-f1d15a92-dccc-43d2-b4bd-c92c82527055" facs="#m-9b5bafc8-e4d1-45dc-947b-59d5faec2612" label="lyrics-like">gré-gi-e Dóctor Páule, mó-res instru-e, Et</l><l xml:id="m-df942382-d543-4e44-9d6d-ee4db16ef8d8" facs="#m-c8d53d74-cde6-4571-8076-0d518e244b17" label="ambiguous">W</l>